          "ItemText": "What was the date and time of arrest? 17/01/2025 05:00 \n\tReply to caution (if no reply, state 'None') I didn't do anything. \n\tWhat was the location of arrest? TESCO SUPERSTORE, TESCO APPROACH ROAD, UPPER BOAT, PONTYPRIDD, RHONDDA CYNON TAF UK CF37 5SN (TESCO)",
          "PersonUniqueId": "{{DefPersonId1}}"
