          "ItemText": "Date of interview: 18/01/2025 08:52\n\tInterview duration: 1h 8mi \n\tInterviewing officer(s) present during the interview: Constable #SWP99029 READY, BRYAN; Constable #SWP99006 RAMSEY, BARBARA; \n\tAppropriate adult(s) present during the interview: \n\tInterpreter(s) used during the interview: \n\tLegal representative(s) used during the interview: RIOS, BRYCE; \n\tWas the interview a no comment interview? No \n\tDid the suspect provide a prepared statement during the interview? No \n\tWere any special warnings given? No\n\tDuring the interview was the suspect shown any multi-media? No \n\tWere any admissions made? No \n\tDuring the interview the suspect made the following denials Maintained he wasnt in the area as he was not at work that day and had no reason to be there. Denied seeing the Victim that day. \n\tDid the suspect raise any defences? No \n\tHas the suspect offered any mitigation? No",
          "PersonUniqueId": "{{DefPersonId1}}"
        },
