          "ItemText": "Summary of reasonable lines of enquiry pursued, ongoing, or contemplated particularly those that point away from the suspect(s), or which may assist the defence including the rationale for any lines of enquiry not pursued (social media and mobile phones / electronic devices are covered elsewhere so you do not need to cover these here): This is a summary of the enquiries which have been conducted so far. There is no social media or phones which are relevant. No cctv in the area. Have any social media accounts been considered as a reasonable line of enquiry in this case? No Provide the rationale as to why no social media accounts have been considered as a reasonable line of enquiry in this case Facebook has been checked and X. There is nothing relevant which would assist in this case Provide the rationale as to why no mobile / electronic devices have been considered as a reasonable line of enquiry in this case Not relevant for this offence ** Suspect: SIMPSON, ROSS DCFADULT ** Explanation offered by the suspect: Suspect stated he was nowhere near his workplace that day."
        },
